sentences.text:
The petitioner is directed to be enlarged on bail in S.C.No.5032/2024 pending before the Court of III Addl. District & Sessions Judge,
Mandya, sitting at Srirangapatna, arising out of Crime No.86/2023 registered by Mandya Women Police Station, Mandya, for the offences punishable under Sections 498A, 307, 324, 504, 506 IPC, subject to the following conditions:
a) Petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- with two sureties for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
d) The petitioner shall not involve in similar offences in future;
e) The petitioner shall not leave the jurisdiction of the Trial Court without permission of NC: 2024:KHC:32656 the said Court until the case registered against him is disposed off.
Sd/-
(S VISHWAJITH SHETTY) JUDGE KK Manjunatha M vs State Of Karnataka on 13 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/113346807/
